				<wikidot:authorName>Rikks</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1562784</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Oh my god this is so unexpected a speech for me wow.</p> <p>If I see Kanye West anywhere near this speech, I will kill him.</p> <p>Anyway, thanks to everyone for reading and stuff. And upvoting it. And downvoting it, actually. I'd rather get a reaction from you than a neutral 'meh, it's ok, I guess'. Because I want to make the reader feel something, and then I'll know I'm on the right track.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
